[{"id":4025815169,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7v9RCB","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?u=f0c85fe8c24debe91dc14d7efa97b51a19250b47&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This fixes the connection icon not getting scaled when changing the line spacing, but there is another place that this issue happens, when changing the zoom level:\n\n<img width=\"813\" height=\"243\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ba4ee04-5e1b-4e64-841a-c7e1bb64c72c\" />\n\nI think the most reliable way to know when to update it is to connect `code_editor->get_text_editor()` `theme_changed` signal to a new method. And then we could remove the other `set_gutter_width` calls for connection gutter to keep it in once place.\n\nThe issue also mentions they shouldn't be affected by line space, which I agree makes sense. It may be more involved, so if you want we could leave it for another PR.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117911#pullrequestreview-4025815169","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117911","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"